sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as MAXScript License UI
    participant LC as Native LicenseCore
    participant P as Licensing Provider
    U->>UI: Enter license key
    UI->>LC: Activate
    LC->>P: Client-safe activation request
    P-->>LC: Signed activation/entitlement
    LC->>LC: Verify and cache
    LC-->>UI: Status + capabilities
    UI-->>U: Activated
